{"unit_id":"cazhaniyyah603-ui__dafiyu-fold#card-zh","repo":"cazhaniyyah603-ui/dafiyu-fold","commit":"c3a58257762c3a57d16d0bf30e3d8466b09fc665","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dafiyu-fold 是一个面向 DSH 上下文压缩流程的插件：它在 compaction 服务调用 summarize 前，把本次压缩输入整理为 Markdown 并写入本地归档目录，然后调用原有 summarize 并返回其结果。插件通过 Cordis 的 compaction 服务接入，可直接取得服务时应用补丁，也可等待服务注入后再处理。它会按角色标记消息，并提供归档目录和日志路径两个可选环境变量。适合希望在摘要生成后仍能查阅被压缩原始消息的 DSH 用户。使用前需将插件放入 compaction 所在的 isolate 分组；不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:47-64","lib/index.js:66-80","lib/index.js:98-109","lib/index.js:117-135"]}
{"unit_id":"cazhaniyyah603-ui__dafiyu-fold#card-en","repo":"cazhaniyyah603-ui/dafiyu-fold","commit":"c3a58257762c3a57d16d0bf30e3d8466b09fc665","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dafiyu-fold archives each DSH compaction input as Markdown before calling the original summarize method. It connects through the compaction service, labels messages by role, and supports custom archive and log paths. Place it in the compaction isolate group; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:47-64","lib/index.js:66-80","lib/index.js:98-109","lib/index.js:117-135"]}
